    "ruleType": "enhancement",
    "group": "Pantheon of Woe",
    "summary": "TRANSCENDENT C'TAN models only. During your turn, whenever the bearer's unit makes an Ingress or Advance move through its Transdimensional Displacement ability, it may finish the move over 6 inches horizontally away from every enemy unit, rather than over 8 inches. If it finishes the move within 8 inches of an enemy unit, it cannot declare a charge for the rest of the turn. Only the Advance branch currently applies, because Transdimensional Displacement grants only an Advance.",
